{'symbol': 'CAG', 'date': '2021-11-22 07:00:00', 'title': 'CONAGRA BRANDS EMPLOYEES RAISE MORE THAN $520,000 DURING ANNUAL "UNITED FOR CHANGE" CAMPAIGN', 'text': 'CHICAGO, NOV. 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CONAGRA BRANDS ANNOUNCED TODAY THE RESULTS OF ITS ANNUAL "UNITED FOR CHANGE" EMPLOYEE GIVING CAMPAIGN, RAISING MORE THAN $520,000 TO BENEFIT UNITED WAY, THE AMERICAN CIVIL LIBERTIES UNION FOUNDATION (ACLU), AND HUMAN RIGHTS WATCH.\xa0THE CAMPAIGN IS DESIGNED TO INCREASE EMPLOYEES\' UNDERSTANDING OF THE ROOT CAUSES OF POVERTY WHILE ALSO PRIORITIZING ISSUES OF RACIAL AND SOCIAL JUSTICE.'}